# Public Page Brand System

- A new public page is an extension of the existing site, not a standalone landing-page design.
- Before markup or CSS, choose the closest approved production page and record it as the canonical visual source in the UI contract.
- Wedding expert and SEO pages inherit `/scenario/`: portrait-led dark Hero, warm-neutral body, orange accent, `Cormorant Garamond` display type, `Instrument Serif` italic role, established editorial spacing and existing CTA controls.
- Reuse existing components, tokens, assets and interaction patterns before adding page-local variants.
- Do not introduce a separate palette, generic SEO-card template, unrelated type system or redrawn Telegram/MAX controls.
- Content structure may vary when the user job requires it, but the brand identity and interaction language must remain recognizable.
- A new visual language requires explicit owner approval before implementation.
- Verify the candidate against its canonical page on mobile and desktop before release.
